 safety is moving off the roadway or lane crossed: while the footprint overlaps r (rel.occupies), the pedestrian moves (kin.speed, 'magnitude of velocity'), at the pace the standard bounds. kin.speed is used as the magnitude of motion, not as acceleration."}],"operationalizations":[{"span":"st","standard":"as soon as possible","concepts":["kin.speed"],"params":["p.pedestrian_clearing_speed_min"],"convention":"pedestrian clearance walking speed: a pedestrian still on the roadway after the steady indication proceeds as soon as possible where its speed is at least a floor well below the slow walking speed the clearance interval is timed for; lingering or halting on the roadway is below it","surrogate":false}],"assumptions":[],"intentions":[],"compositions":[{"span":"r","rule":"NRS_484B_287_1c","map":{"subject":"subject"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"NRS_484B_287_1d","map":{"subject":"subject"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"NRS_484B_287_1e","map":{"subject":"subject"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"LVMC_11_30_060_A","map":{"subject":"subject"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"LVMC_11_30_060_B","map":{"subject":"subject"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"LVMC_11_30_140_B_o1","map":{"subject":"subject"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"LVMC_11_30_140_B_o2","map":{"subject":"subject"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"LVMC_11_46_030_o1","map":{"subject":"v"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"r","rule":"LVMC_11_46_030_o2","map":{"subject":"v"},"as":"exception"},{"span":"ref2","as":"definition","source":"NRS-484B-283-1d1","quote":"While the “Walk” indication or walking person symbol is illuminated, pedestrians facing the signal may proceed across the highway in the direction of the signal"},{"span":"ref2","as":"definition","source":"NRS-484B-283-1d2","quote":"While the “Don’t Walk” or “Wait” indication or an upraised hand symbol is illuminated, is flashing and is accompanied by a countdown timer, a pedestrian may proceed across the highway